 the original confusion.\r\n\t- I would stick to adding the example in this PR. It's completely fine. No worries.\r\n- Potentially recommend more to the reader to see `set_input_as_handled`\r\n    - Not sure how, at the moment. The current description _seems_ to already do this.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807224749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2807289554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105426#issuecomment-2807289554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105426","id":2807289554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nU9bS","user":{"login":"hidemat","id":6559151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTkxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6559151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat","html_url":"https://github.com/hidemat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hidemat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T19:38:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T19:38:15Z","body":"Yeah you're right. I did click on the **Viewport** `set_input_as_handled`'s link provided in the _input() description, and was still con